WEBVTT

NOTE Generated fixture: dialogue only.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.940 line:85%
<v Nadia>Eight minutes. What happens at midnight?

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.540 line:85%
<v Theo>An automatic purge. Every backup older than one day disappears.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.180 line:85%
<v Nadia>Twelve transfers. Forty-eight million dollars. All to the same shell company.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.440 line:85%
<v Theo>Halcyon Bay Holdings. Look who signed the incorporation papers.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.720 line:85%
<v Nadia>Selene. She slapped me in front of everyone for her own crime.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:41.500 line:85%
<v Grant>Yes, the girl is finished. Every newspaper runs the gala video tomorrow.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.780 line:85%
<v Grant>But she saw the pension numbers. Make sure the auditor never testifies.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.680 line:85%
<v Nadia>He's talking about killing me.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.600 line:85%
<v Theo>Don't move. The download needs ninety more seconds.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.000 line:85%
<v Grant>Why is this terminal on?

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.040 line:85%
<v Grant>I know someone is in here.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:22.300 line:85%
<v Grant>Come out now, or I call the men who don't ask questions. Who's there?
